// of thermodynamics (1999); Reed and Simon, Methods of Modern Mathematical Physics I–IV (1972–1979); Lieb and Seiringer,
// The Stability of Matter in Quantum Mechanics (2010); Streater and Wightman, PCT, Spin and Statistics, and All That
// (1964); Friedli and Velenik, Statistical Mechanics of Lattice Systems (2017); Hawking and Ellis, The Large Scale
// Structure of Space-Time (1973); Wald, General Relativity (1984); Chandrasekhar, An Introduction to the Study of
// Stellar Structure (1939). Not checked by a specialist.
// Checked by ../../tests/check-concepts.js.

