      formula: String.raw`-\operatorname{div} \sigma(u) = f,\quad \sigma = \lambda\, (\operatorname{tr} \varepsilon)\, I + 2\mu\, \varepsilon,\quad \varepsilon(u) = \tfrac12 (\nabla u + \nabla u^T)`,
